## SKU Price

### SKU Price Eligibility Object Schema

The SKU Price Eligibility Object Schema defines the structure for the [SKU Price Eligibility](#datamodel.skuprice.skupriceeligibility) column.

> **Preview:** The SKU Price Eligibility Object Schema defines a column of the SKU Price dataset, which is a preview in this version of FOCUS. While that dataset is a preview, this schema may change in the next version without a deprecation notice.

[Download from GitHub](/specification/schemas/datasets/skuprice/skupriceeligibilityobjectschema.json)

